<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb coal output at 189 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb coal output at 189 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 189 million tonnes of coal in January and February, up 5.1 percent from the same two months last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 84.98 million tonnes of coal in February alone, the bureau said without giving a comparative figure.</p>
<p>--Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1961</p>
</text>
